      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EXPRESS POLO (1) finds it hard to break through. Finished second (43.90) at this track last time making it two minors on end. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Top chance in this line up. BLACK TIGER (8) was prominent throughout when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when 5th and beaten 14 lengths at Gawler (38.62). Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Key runner on best form. WEBLEC POLLY (4) was the fastest winner on the program last time out, running away to score by 2.25 lengths (39.54) at Murray Bridge. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. One of the leading chances again. AKELA MARTIAL (2) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot most recently.",
